                  "kind": "text",
                  "data": "All three files are created. Here's a summary of everything that was built:\n\n---\n\n**Files created in `C:\\Users\\Mutiarasada\\dashboard\\`:**\n\n- `index.html` — semantic HTML structure with ARIA labels\n- `style.css` — 512 lines of CSS\n- `app.js` — 399 lines of Vanilla JS\n\n**Every requirement implemented:**\n\n| Feature | Detail |\n|---|---|\n| Purple gradient background | `#6E57E5 → #9b59b6` via CSS custom properties |\n| Grid layout | Top full-width card, 2-column middle row, bottom full-width card |\n| Clock | Live `hh:mm:ss` ticking every second |\n| Date & Greeting | Full date below clock; \"Good Morning/Afternoon/Evening/Night\" |\n| Focus Timer | 25:00 countdown with Start / Stop / Reset; fires browser notification on completion |\n| Tasks | Add (Enter or button), checkbox toggle, red Delete, duplicate check (case-insensitive), persisted |\n| Quick Links | Name + URL inputs, validates `http/https`, blue pill buttons with ✕ delete, 3 defaults pre-loaded |\n| Name modal | Shown only on first visit; \"Change name\" button reopens it anytime |\n| Dark mode toggle | 🌙/☀️ button in top-right of clock card; persists to localStorage |\n| LocalStorage | All state (name, theme, tasks, links) survives page refresh |\n| Responsive | Single-column stacking below 640 px |\n\n**To open it:** just double-click `index.html` in File Explorer — it runs entirely in the browser with no server needed."
